00:29:49,340 --> 00:29:50,280
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: with the ICC.

446
00:29:50,920 --> 00:29:52,000
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: Ano na po ang status

447
00:29:52,000 --> 00:29:53,200
Rep. Percival "Perci" Cendaña: nitong effort na ito?

448
00:29:53,280 --> 00:29:54,060
