1355
01:16:40,660 --> 01:16:46,280
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: ang directly allocated to operationalized rapid response legal deployment teams,

1356
01:16:46,780 --> 01:16:51,800
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: especially for rural and conflict-afflicted areas where access to counsel is severely limited?

1357
01:16:53,940 --> 01:16:57,140
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Hingi lang po ako ng permiso, Madam Chair, to check our...

1358
01:16:58,800 --> 01:17:06,280
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Wala po kasi kaming budget dedicated for red-tagging.

1359
01:17:06,280 --> 01:17:08,440
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: For it right now. Dahil bago rin po yung...

1360
01:17:08,440 --> 01:17:12,060
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Opo. Naka-lump po siya sa aming protection service.

1361
01:17:13,640 --> 01:17:26,980
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang total po kasi ng aming budget, allotment for protection program ay 323,278,000.

1362
01:17:28,380 --> 01:17:29,440
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ito po yung...

1363
01:17:30,340 --> 01:17:34,100
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: kabuuan ng Human Rights Protection Service.

1364
01:17:34,500 --> 01:17:37,460
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So kung yung kabuuan, ibig po sabihin nito ay investigation,

1365
01:17:38,920 --> 01:17:42,420
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: legal services, legal assistance,

1366
01:17:42,940 --> 01:17:46,200
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: forensic services,

1367
01:17:47,520 --> 01:17:49,280
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: witness assistance and protection,

1368
01:17:51,690 --> 01:17:52,270
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: and then,

1369
01:17:53,310 --> 01:17:58,870
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: humahati pa po dyan yung budget for the prevention service, yung pong jail visitation.

1370
01:17:59,750 --> 01:18:01,290
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, hindi po ako makapagbibigyan.

1371
01:18:01,650 --> 01:18:10,150
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Hindi po ako makapagbibigyan ng exact figure dedicated for this activity na tinatanong po ninyo, Your Honor.

1372
01:18:10,910 --> 01:18:17,910
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: But, to give you the figure in totality, yun po siya.

1373
01:18:18,270 --> 01:18:23,370
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Protection service. Kabuuan po ito ng protection program ng komisyon.

1374
01:18:24,870 --> 01:18:29,690
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And siguro, tanong ko na lang din po, given na may report po tayo,

1375
