Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and then may recommendations tayo,

1376
01:18:31,650 --> 01:18:36,070
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: bahagi po ba yung recommendations, yung pagbuuan ng protocols or guidelines,

1377
01:18:36,070 --> 01:18:40,810
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung paano po gamitin yung pondo na ito para po mag-rapid response kung kailangan po?

1378
01:18:40,810 --> 01:18:45,610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes po. Kasama po yun sa recommendation and of course, the strategy of the commission.

1379
01:18:45,610 --> 01:18:50,210
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Maaari po bang makahingi din po ng kopya ang representation na ito through the committee

1380
01:18:50,210 --> 01:18:52,410
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: kung nabuo na po yung guidelines?

1381
01:18:52,410 --> 01:18:56,590
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes. Opo. I-submit po namin yung ito.

1382
01:18:56,590 --> 01:19:00,990
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Thank you very much. And siguro, ang final manifestation ko na lang din po,

1383
01:19:01,650 --> 01:19:09,450
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: dahil red tagging also increasingly operates through digital platforms, doxing, deepfix, and coordinated online campaigns,

1384
01:19:09,450 --> 01:19:17,950
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: may funding po din sanang allocated and guidelines provided towards digital forensic tools, cyber threat monitoring systems,

1385
01:19:17,950 --> 01:19:22,350
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: and secure database infrastructure to preserve digital evidence.

1386
01:19:22,350 --> 01:19:26,710
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Lalo na po mas nakikita natin yung state-backed vilification.

1387
01:19:26,710 --> 01:19:31,490
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And of course, similarly sa pagtingin at pag-alam natin,

1388
