Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: Ang dulo naman po nito, Madam Chair, nakikita natin na ang human rights situation sa Pilipinas,

1394
01:20:14,590 --> 01:20:17,990
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: hindi po natin nakikita yung improvement.

1395
01:20:17,990 --> 01:20:29,790
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: And so, yung mas dagdag na pondo, suporta sa CHR, at lalo na rin po yung sa pag-capacitate at pag-empower ng mga civil society organizations,

1396
01:20:29,790 --> 01:20:31,290
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: people's organizations,

1397
01:20:31,290 --> 01:20:38,790
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: na mapag-aralan nila kung ano yung human rights nila, mapanghawakan, maprotektahan nila nang sama-sama yung instrument and key

1398
01:20:38,790 --> 01:20:44,790
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: para po malabanan yung systematic violations na nararanasan natin ngayon.

1399
01:20:44,790 --> 01:20:51,790
Rep. Renee Louise M. Co: That's all, Madam Chair. Maraming salamat po. And of course, tuloy-tuloy po sana ang gawain ng CHR.

1400
