1421
01:22:41,490 --> 01:22:45,490
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Well, some of my questions have been touched already.

1422
01:22:45,490 --> 01:22:53,490
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Although, I came here also to express my full, to manifest my full support for the budget of the CHR

1423
01:22:53,490 --> 01:22:56,490
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: and to appeal for the restoration of

