Rep. Leila M. de Lima: You're the Tier 2. You're Tier 2 proposals.

1426
01:23:03,490 --> 01:23:10,490
Rep. Leila M. de Lima: Para sa akin kasi, this committee must look at the CHR budget

1427
01:23:10,490 --> 01:23:13,490
