Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: function also include

1626
01:39:11,050 --> 01:39:15,390
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: monitoring government agencies' compliance with laws.

1627
01:39:15,470 --> 01:39:21,410
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: For instance, the compliance of RA 9710 or the Magna Carta on Women.

1628
01:39:21,590 --> 01:39:23,290
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Is that also part of your function?

1629
01:39:23,790 --> 01:39:24,610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes, Your Honor.

1630
01:39:25,210 --> 01:39:32,730
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, are you closely monitoring the Philippine Commission on Women

1631
01:39:32,730 --> 01:39:39,070
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: in their monitoring of the compliance of government agencies

1632
01:39:39,070 --> 01:39:42,750
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: in the requirement of RA 9710?

1633
01:39:42,750 --> 01:39:47,590
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Do we have findings or reports about that?

1634
01:39:49,250 --> 01:39:50,690
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Thank you, Madam Chair.

1635
01:39:51,810 --> 01:39:57,430
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: You're right. We have a connection with the Philippine Commission on Women.

1636
01:39:59,430 --> 01:40:07,990
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: And aside from that, we also do gender-based violence mapping of local government units.

1637
01:40:09,070 --> 01:40:16,070
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: And also, the monitoring of Barangay Baudesk, Violence Against Women Desk.

1638
01:40:17,710 --> 01:40:21,450
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, I forgot, I missed the other question.

1639
01:40:21,450 --> 01:40:29,030
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes. Yung isa po kasing problema natin diyan from the last report that I saw from the Philippine Commission on Women,

1640
01:40:29,730 --> 01:40:36,230
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: madami pong government agencies ang hindi pa rin compliant doon sa requirement ng RA 9710.

1641
01:40:36,230 --> 01:40:38,230
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So, meron po ba tayong ginagawa kapag

1642
01:40:39,070 --> 01:40:39,570
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: um,

1643
01:40:40,470 --> 01:40:41,870
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: consistently,

1644
01:40:42,150 --> 01:40:47,510
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: ang nakikita po kasi natin, consistent yung failure to comply with the requirements of the law.

1645
01:40:47,510 --> 01:40:50,430
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Parang taon-taon po talaga hindi nagagawa.

1646
01:40:50,730 --> 01:40:54,290
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So ano po ang pwedeng magawa ng CHR diyan?

1647
01:40:55,510 --> 01:40:57,250
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Maraming salamat po, Madam Chair, Your Honor.

1648
01:40:57,470 --> 01:41:03,170
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ang ginawa po ng Commission at ng PCW dito sa aspetong ito ay

1649
01:41:03,170 --> 01:41:08,610
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: nag-issue po kami jointly with the PCW

1650
01:41:08,610 --> 01:41:21,510
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ng notice po sa mga agencies upang sila ay magpaliwanag kung bakit hindi nila

1651
01:41:21,510 --> 01:41:25,870
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: nasusunod, natutupad yung requirements ng batas.

1652
01:41:27,610 --> 01:41:31,850
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Meron na po bang mga paliwanag? Do we have anything na?

1653
01:41:31,850 --> 01:41:35,500
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Ongoing po, kailan po?

1654
01:41:35,500 --> 01:41:41,710
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: This year po namin nagawa yun. So siguro ongoing po, wala po kasi akong data sa ngayon.

1655
01:41:41,830 --> 01:41:47,410
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ongoing po yung pasok siguro ng mga compliance ng mga government agencies dito.

1656
01:41:48,090 --> 01:41:52,550
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: We'll just provide update po kung ano man po yung merong available sa amin sa ngayon.

1657
01:41:52,550 --> 01:41:58,490
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Yes po. Siguro ang pakiusap ko na lamang po sa CHR na maging medyo ano po tayo,

1658
01:41:58,650 --> 01:42:01,830
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: stricto siguro this time kasi antagal-tagal.

1659
01:42:01,850 --> 01:42:06,750
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: na po nung batas. Hindi po nako-comply talaga yung nakasaad doon.

1660
01:42:06,810 --> 01:42:11,850
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: Maybe it's about time that maging seryoso po tayo sa paghahabol sa mga ahensya

1661
01:42:11,850 --> 01:42:14,110
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: to comply with the provisions of the law.

1662
01:42:14,530 --> 01:42:22,350
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: So my last question would be, Madam Speaker, yung budget cut from your original proposal

1663
01:42:22,350 --> 01:42:28,490
