1664
01:42:28,490 --> 01:42:30,610
Rep. Iris Marie Demesa Montes: as the gender ombud?

1665
01:42:31,850 --> 01:42:40,290
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Bago ko lang po sagutin, balikan ko lamang po yung kanina una on the compliance of government agencies.

1666
01:42:41,310 --> 01:42:50,810
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So ang isa pong strategy na ginawa ng commission ng CHR at ng PCW is we come up with a memorandum of agreement

1667
01:42:50,810 --> 01:42:59,650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: para kami po ay we can jointly monitor the compliance of these government agencies under the Magna Carta of Women.

1668
01:42:59,970 --> 01:43:01,650
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Ngayon po dun sa inyong...

1669
01:43:01,850 --> 01:43:10,520
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: sumunod na katanungan, as I said, katulad po ng mga tanong kanina na nauna,

1670
