CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: mas makakatulong po ng gusto.

1677
01:43:49,720 --> 01:43:56,120
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: In fact, sa mga previous budget deliberation in previous years po,

1678
