1729
01:48:20,120 --> 01:48:21,840
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: At pangalawa, yung pong center.

1730
01:48:21,840 --> 01:48:24,840
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, naghahati po sila doon sa budget na...

1731
