CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: 79,342,000.

1732
01:48:29,660 --> 01:48:31,160
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yung pong mga...

1733
01:48:31,820 --> 01:48:36,940
