1738
01:48:52,680 --> 01:48:53,380
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Meron po.

1739
01:48:53,380 --> 01:48:54,660
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Para mapalawak.

1740
01:48:55,000 --> 01:48:56,020
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: At mapagyaman pa ang kanilang...

