1743
01:49:03,480 --> 01:49:06,560
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at ang Center for Social Justice and Humanitarian Protection.

1744
01:49:07,140 --> 01:49:09,580
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Abukad pa po sa napakahalaga na Child Rights Center

1745
01:49:09,580 --> 01:49:11,960
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: at Center for Gender Equality and Women's Human Rights.

1746
01:49:12,340 --> 01:49:16,620
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Mahalaga ito, Madam Chair, dahil sa mga gawain din natin dito sa Kongreso.

