1759
01:50:12,130 --> 01:50:13,950
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Yes po, Madam Chair, Your Honor.

1760
01:50:14,290 --> 01:50:18,630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: Kasama po sa mga regular activities ng ating mga regional offices,

1761
01:50:18,850 --> 01:50:20,050
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: ang community-based dialogues.

1762
01:50:23,250 --> 01:50:27,070
Rep. Sarah Jane I. Elago: Ilan po yung mga participants at mga naaabot ng mga dialogues na ito?

