1823
01:56:30,510 --> 01:56:38,190
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: From 1987 to 2025, more than 20,000 or almost 30,000 cases po ito.

1824
01:56:39,630 --> 01:56:52,170
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, pagkatapos po yan, mas makakatutok na kami sa mga current cases na nasa around 2,942 cases na lamang po tayo.

1825
01:56:52,830 --> 01:56:59,630
CHR Chairperson Richard P. Palpal-latoc: So, mas mapapabilis na po yung investigation and conclusion of the investigation of these cases.

1826
